# Only **auth and registry** settings are read from `.npmrc` by pnpm 10+.
# Everything else lives in `pnpm-workspace.yaml` — see the note there.
#
# This file is intentionally almost empty. It previously held four behavioural
# settings that pnpm had silently stopped reading, and npm's "Unknown project
# config" warnings on every invocation were the signal nobody was reading.
